===Etymology===
From {{inh|tr|ota|كوپك|tr=köpek}}, from {{der|tr|trk-pro|*köpek}}. Either from {{m|tr|köp}} (in the sense of "a herd of many dogs"),<ref>[http://www.nisanyansozluk.com/?k=k%C3%B6pek Nisanyan Dictionary]</ref> or from {{m|tr|kelebek|t=butterfly}}.<ref>ToB - Proto-Turkic: [http://starling.rinet.ru/cgi-bin/response.cgi?single=1&basename=%5Cdata%5Calt%5Cturcet&text_recno=19&root=config *köpek]</ref> {{cog|cjs|xopax|t=butterfly}} reflects the only exact semantical match.<ref>ToB - Proto-Turkic: [http://starling.rinet.ru/cgi-bin/response.cgi?single=1&basename=%2fdata%2falt%2fturcet&text_number=1001&root=config *kepelek]</ref>

